abstract: >-
  Interactive simulations and short, runnable code on how language models work.
  First piece: "Training a Transformer", a step-by-step simulation of one training run of a tiny GPT
  (tokenizer, embeddings, attention, MLP, loss, backpropagation, updates, sampling), with tiny_gpt.py,
  the 300-line PyTorch script behind every number.
keywords:
